OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe grass fire which
OL,4,Adestroyed businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched into the cause of a grass fire
OL,8,Fwhich destroyed several businesses on
OL,9,Fan industrial estate.
OL,11,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service was called
OL,12,Fto a blaze at Locking Farm Industrial
OL,13,FEstate in Weston-super-Mare at 03:03
OL,14,FBST on Tuesday. The fire closed the
OL,15,FA371 for most of the day.
OL,17,FAvon and Somerset Police has now urged
OL,18,Fanyone who may have seen people acting
OL,19,Fsuspiciously on or near the A371
OL,20,Fbetween 02:00 and 03:00 on Tuesday to
OL,21,Fspeak to them.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
