OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe grass fire which
OL,4,Adestroyed businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was fortunate nobody was seriously
OL,7,Fharmed during this incident, and
OL,8,Fmembers of the public should expect to
OL,9,Fsee an increased presence in the area
OL,10,Fwhile enquiries continue," said
OL,11,Fneighbourhood Ch Insp Andy Barry.
